    description: "Found by the 2026-11-01 P3 stale-item review (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/, dev 100b6fbb6e). _extract_receiver_type_from_node (go.py:1361) handles only type_identifier and pointer_type receiver nodes, so a generic_type receiver yields no type name and the method symbol is minted unqualified (go:a.go:5-5:Foo:method). Consequence: typed calls x.Foo() with x Box[int] resolve ambiguous. Fixture gorc1/fx_moloj2. Split out of WI-moloj (part 3)."  # 1653
